{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24783","headline":"一字至七字诗 · 白居易","name":"一字至七字诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗，绮美，瓌奇。\n明月夜，落花时。\n能助欢笑，亦伤别离。\n调清金石怨，吟苦鬼神悲。\n天下只应我爱，世间唯有君知。\n自从都尉别苏句，便到司空送白辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}